      "message": "Exactly the type of problem I was thinking about. Agreed that it can\u0027t actually hit slow path that many times.\n\nAs for the tradeoff, timer ticks could be anywhere from sub ms to seconds. 16s worth of tcp timers could potentially be a lot of events, but those at least are paced. So, on second thought, I think I like this one shot fix better than waiting.",
